      "message": "This could overflow because `indirectOffset` could be a really large 64 bit number, and we could then add up to `UINT32_MAX * 16` to that.\n\nOne way to handle this is to first fail if:\n`indirectOffset \u003e indirectBuffer-\u003eGetSize()`\nthen fail if:\n`indirectBuffer-\u003eGetSize() - indirectOffset \u003c maxDrawCount * kDrawIndirectSize`.\n\n(Note: `maxDrawCount * kDrawIndirectSize` can\u0027t overflow, because `maxDrawCount` is 32-bit and `kDrawIndirectSize` is 64-bit so the result will be 64-bit.)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 343,
        "startChar": 49,
        "endLine": 343,
        "endChar": 98
      },
